      "updated_at": "2018-02-02T07:53:11Z",
      "body": "You can either create an interest group and insert that as checkbox, or just create a checkbox that is required (and don't record it as nobody could submit the form without checking it anyway).\r\n\r\nIf you need more information on how to do this, please created a support request. \r\n\r\nWe only use git for development related issues. For free support please create a ticket at https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/mailchimp-for-wp",
