      "updated_at": "2018-02-04T16:10:30Z",
      "body": "My checkbox is required, but GDPR requires proof of consent in my datebase.\r\nRequired data is: when did it happen (date), from which IP and at what time.\r\n\r\nHow can I achieve that?",
