      "created_at": "2018-04-10T09:46:55Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-04-10T09:46:55Z",
      "body": "Hi @Mishef,\r\n\r\nA tad late but as I am working on this now, I just wanted to get back to you on this after all. Our plugin sends the email address, IP address and timestamp to MailChimp which then stores it. This should act as a written record of the explicit consent provided that you are using clear language in your forms.",
