      "created_at": "2018-04-10T12:17:22Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-04-10T12:17:22Z",
      "body": "Hello, @dannyvankooten.\r\nIt is necessary to have a record of consent and what the consumer has agreed to at that time.\r\nI have a required checkbox with the following text in my websites \"I want to subscribe to news from COMPANY\". This is not enough for GDPR, because I need to have information in the database that the user has agreed exactly with this statement on that time of entering his data.",
